  "id": "agy-text-delta-step-item-live",
  "concept": "response-update-assembly",
  "description": "SANITIZED LIVE RECORDING (Antigravity CLI 1.4.6, always-proceed mode): the answer streams as text_delta fragments of agent-response step 11. The ACTIVE record is a Partial view of that step item with its fragment \"4\"; the DONE record completes the item with its last fragment and the step's own usage; the result carries the turn's whole response \"4\\n\" and the session's cumulative usage. The step index is the item's identity (99, Conversation step index), never a provider response id; whether input includes cache reads and whether thinking is part of output are not stated, so no uncached tranche and no reasoning relation is written.",
